  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="huge-typography" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="huge-line"><div class="huge-text ht-1">SOFTWARE</div></div>
      <div class="huge-line"><div class="huge-text ht-2 outline-text">ENGINEER</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <div class="hero-bottom-left gs-reveal">
        <span class="label">Muhammad Raffi Aqsan</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-bottom-right gs-reveal">
        <p class="body-lg about-intro">
          I'm a junior software engineer and IT support technician with a vocational background in Software Engineering (July 2023 – May 2026) and 6 months of internship experience at BRIN. I build pragmatic web applications and troubleshoot IT systems, with an active curiosity in cybersecurity and Web3.
        </p>
